Read AGENTS.md at the repository root and follow it. It is the single source of
truth for this repo; this file exists only to point you there.

Most easily broken rules: never edit courses/*/tests/** or
courses/*/.shipthatcode.json; write solutions only in the course's declared
entrypoint (one file per course, no extra modules, no added build system);
never install a toolchain on the host, use scripts/stc which runs Docker; tests
are byte-exact; do not paste course lesson prose into tracked files.
